<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>

<preface xml:id="bibtex-example">
    <title>BibTeX Example</title>
    <p>
        Let's say that I want to cite something.
    </p>
    <p>
        In our <c>main.ptx</c>, I've linked all of our references in the Zotero. You can find them in the <c>references.bib</c> file in the root folder of our repository.
    </p>
    <p>
        If I then want to go and cite something, I say:
        <cd>
            &lt;biblio src = "???"&gt;citation&lt;/biblio&gt;
        </cd>
        This will result in a citation. 
        
    </p>

    
    
    

</preface>